# OS and editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Note: data/ holds JSON measurement results and is intentionally NOT
# ignored. Do not add data/ or data/** here.
#
# The one exception: Tier 2 run artifacts. An interposer frame log carries
# complete tool-call arguments and, under --full-results, complete tool output,
# which interposer/README.md's security section classifies as a secret of the
# same grade as the credentials the server was given. The per-trial client JSON
# and the fixture scratch copies sit beside it. Only the derived Tier 2 summary
# is publishable, and it is written outside this tree.
/data/tier2/
